WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:05.687
Polycyclic aromatic hydrocarbons resist easy dispersion in aqueous

00:00:05.687 --> 00:00:10.824
environments. Polymer assemblies offer one route to changing exposure.

00:00:15.633 --> 00:00:20.469
Amphiphilic polymer micelles can provide compartments for hydrophobic compounds.

00:00:20.469 --> 00:00:25.304
The thermodynamic argument begins before the mixture is made.

00:00:29.925 --> 00:00:34.687
Actual diblock-copolymer handling and dissolution did not always

00:00:34.687 --> 00:00:39.449
match our expectations. This archive retains an unsuccessful experiment.

00:00:43.925 --> 00:00:48.708
Micellisation depends on solvent, composition and real processing. No

00:00:48.708 --> 00:00:53.492
neat drawing replaces measurements on the system actually prepared.

00:00:58.008 --> 00:01:02.089
The difference between an ideal formulation and a workable one can

00:01:02.089 --> 00:01:06.170
be a physical materials problem, not a failure to know the theory.

00:01:10.133 --> 00:01:15.028
The grant-supported investigation and its trials belong in

00:01:15.028 --> 00:01:19.922
the scientific account without manufacturing a successful solubilisation result.
